# CRITICAL DEPLOYMENT INFORMATION

## THE ONLY APPROVED DEPLOYMENT METHOD

Local ’ GitHub ’ Qual (stackmap.app/qual) ’ Production (stackmap.app)

Commands:
- Deploy to Qual: ./scripts/deploy-to-qual.sh
- Deploy to Prod: ./scripts/deploy-qual-to-prod.sh

NEVER:
- Deploy directly to production
- Use GitHub Actions
- Remove console.logs
- Create new deployment methods

See /DEPLOYMENT.md for details.